msgstr ""
"Načini rada CAN FD filtra (argument ``mode`` za :meth:`setfilter` na OpenMV "
"Cam H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal):"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:482
msgid ""
"The filter ``params`` array holds two IDs forming a range of accepted IDs."
msgstr ""
"Polje filtra ``params`` sadrži dva ID-a koja tvore raspon prihvaćenih ID-"
